The trapping *shape* — inflowing horizontal boundaries, strict leftward motion, one reachable critical point — is the same architecture as GP-DER-008 Lemma 3.1, reached independently. That is corroboration of the approach and nothing more; GP-DER-008 executes it correctly and W01 does not.

